  "summary": "Which part of this horse's left iris is a second colour - sectoral heterochromia, as ten named alleles: four halves, four corners and the two diagonals. All ten are recessive to the wild type and to each other. It says where, not what: the colour is the sector-colour locus's, and a horse wild type here shows nothing whatever that locus says.",
